WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Cosmo is not an avatar.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:15.000
Ask one thing.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.660
You choose who to continue with.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.960
Identity lets others recognize you.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.160
Knowledge holds your judgment.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.800
Capability lets others call on you.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.800
